          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "NASSCOM Chair: AI Will Accelerate India's Tech Industry, Not Replace Its Workforce",
            "articleSection": "Job Evolution",
            "abstract": "Newly appointed NASSCOM Chairman Srikanth Velamakanni has stated publicly that AI will act as an accelerator for India's technology sector rather than a threat to employment, affirming that the tech industry will continue hiring people. His remarks come at a critical juncture as India's IT sector faces twin pressures of geopolitical uncertainty and rapid AI-driven disruption. NASSCOM represents hundreds of Indian IT firms employing millions of workers, giving this leadership position significant weight in shaping industry and government narratives around AI and jobs.",
            "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/tech/technology/ai-to-accelerate-indias-tech-industry-not-a-threat-tech-to-continue-hiring-people-nasscom-chair/articleshow/130531908.cms",
            "publisher": {
